   "QUESTION_DESC": "<p><strong data-end=\"483\" data-start=\"270\">Explain and perform binary addition and subtraction using Sign-Magnitude, 1&rsquo;s Complement, and 2&rsquo;s Complement methods. Also, describe and solve binary multiplication and division problems using proper rules.</strong></p>\n",
